    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54866" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπολεμ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>war down</i>, i.e. <i>exhaust by war, reduce</i>, 
